<Property name="DestinationTargetConfigNameMap">
<Description><![CDATA[
Secret Key Password
<p>This setting holds the comma seperated list of immediate destination code(bank routing Number) and the associated 
Ftp operation name .</br> e.g  Destination1:TargetConfigName,Destination2:TargetConfigName </br>
Every time new destination code is added in Select bank they will need to convey that to IHC and we should add that to this settings.</br>
If the destination points to new server of keybank then a new operation needs to be created and also need to be added to the 
target confignames  parameter.
</br>If it the new operation is not created the processing will end in error.</p>]]></Description>
<Type>%String</Type>
<InitialExpression>"124000737:Out-KeyBank-EncryptedEftFile-Ftps,124303007:Out-KeyBank-EncryptedEftFile-Ftps"</InitialExpression>
<Parameter name="MAXLEN" value="500"/>
</Property>

